<title>SINGAPORE: Ossia to buy prime residential property.</title>
<headline>Ossia to buy prime residential property.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sporting goods and apparel dealer Ossia International Ltd said on Monday it plans to buy a prime residential property in Singapore to develop high-rise apartments.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement the site, consisting of the freehold properties at Suffolk Road, central Singapore, would be acquired by Regalia Investment Co Pte.</p>
<p>Regalia, a company acquired by Ossia's subsidiary Ossia Land Pte Ltd in February, has an option to buy the 1,624 square metre site for S$22.9 million.</p>
<p>The company plans to develop a 30-storey building.</p>
<p>Ossia also said that the proposed property purchase and development would be financed internally and by bank borrowings.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65-870 3084)</p>
